    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveIdeviceMac">Execute: 'brew install libimobiledevice' no Terminal.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveIdeviceLinux">Execute: 'sudo apt-get install libimobiledevice-utils' no Terminal.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveIdeviceinfo">Verifique se o conjunto completo do libimobiledevice está instalado.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveAdbWin">Instale o Android SDK Platform-Tools ou copie o adb.exe para o diretório idevice-tools.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveAdbMac">Execute: 'brew install android-platform-tools' no Terminal.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveAdbLinux">Execute: 'sudo apt-get install adb' no Terminal.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveTunnel">Instale o conector de túnel ou coloque o cloudflared no diretório 'idevice-tools'.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveUsbmuxdPortable">Inicie o daemon usbmuxd portátil em segundo plano.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveAppleService">Baixe e instale o driver leve da Apple e o daemon usbmuxd.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveUsbmuxdMac">Verifique se o usbmuxd está rodando ou reinicie o computador.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Diag_ResolveUsbmuxdLinux">Execute: 'sudo systemctl start usbmuxd' ou 'sudo usbmuxd -f -v'.</x:String>
